'''Rellor''' (Japanese: '''シガロコ''' ''Shigaroko'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

