==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Rellor|26}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Ball Roll''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Spheal|45}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

